{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a. General Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Soccer Online is a fast-paced multiplayer street soccer game that captures the energy and fun of the sport. With no rules to hold you back, this game delivers a pure, exhilarating soccer experience. Play as both a player and a goalkeeper, and immerse yourself in the spirit of street soccer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>b. Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rules Soccer:</strong> Feel the freedom and dynamism of street soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Both Player and Goalkeeper:</strong> Show your skills in every position on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Fun:</strong> Simple controls make it easy to play, but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps: Various maps are coming soon as the game continues to evolve!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes: Ball growth mode and ball rain mode available (New game modes coming soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Create strategies with realistic football movements and collisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>c. Game Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Street Soccer Online, the goal is simple: score goals, outplay your opponents, and have fun! Players can dribble, shoot, and tackle on the field or block shots as a goalkeeper. Matches are short and fast-paced, maximizing the excitement and fun factor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>d. Developer\u2019s Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;One Developer, One Big Dream&quot;</strong><br>Street Soccer Online is a project built entirely by a solo developer. Capturing the essence of street soccer and sharing it with players has been my ultimate goal. I am committed to improving the game with your feedback and taking it to the next level. Your support on this journey means everything to me!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"5 LEVEL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/3cad2a60596b768099c9f7a2035aa03b741b719f.jpg"},{"name":"10 LEVEL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/0c3a74e2b4a0f4f4880820c3571d25c37b8e0f16.jpg"},{"name":"20 LEVEL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/3a6e34f7a4813f248535cbf49e633a632c30826d.jpg"},{"name":"50 LEVEL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/576b434848c9dda4077b5f589aaa95c030cfdf28.jpg"},{"name":"100 LEVEL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/4f4b866e4ac4268efe89eef39bebe22b0cee4ae2.jpg"},{"name":"SCORE 25 GOALS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/e230201a1f1708250973bd9204d3ea1fa6b90fb4.jpg"},{"name":"SCORE 50 GOALS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/7e810b50114366bb2feb759b2d7b008b921f0dd4.jpg"},{"name":"SCORE 100 GOALS!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/bbd1dd92a7f06fffb95f9cbc112f9e13f7e9d1b9.jpg"},{"name":"SCORE 25 ASSIST!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/85a23afda33ee00118729fa0d8e473178df9acc6.jpg"},{"name":"SCORE 50 ASSIST!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344400/85a23afda33ee00118729fa0d8e473178df9acc6.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344400?t=1763656748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344400?t=1763656748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/db9b5ddae4c06c4f59d51934d33fa68fbcb7766f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763656748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/db9b5ddae4c06c4f59d51934d33fa68fbcb7766f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763656748","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a. General Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Soccer Online is a fast-paced multiplayer street soccer game that captures the energy and fun of the sport. With no rules to hold you back, this game delivers a pure, exhilarating soccer experience. Play as both a player and a goalkeeper, and immerse yourself in the spirit of street soccer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>b. Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rules Soccer:</strong> Feel the freedom and dynamism of street soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Both Player and Goalkeeper:</strong> Show your skills in every position on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Fun:</strong> Simple controls make it easy to play, but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps: Various maps are coming soon as the game continues to evolve!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes: Ball growth mode and ball rain mode available (New game modes coming soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Create strategies with realistic football movements and collisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>c. Game Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Street Soccer Online, the goal is simple: score goals, outplay your opponents, and have fun! Players can dribble, shoot, and tackle on the field or block shots as a goalkeeper. Matches are short and fast-paced, maximizing the excitement and fun factor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.poster.avif?t=1763656748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.webm?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.mp4?t=1763656748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>d. Developer\u2019s Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;One Developer, One Big Dream&quot;</strong><br>Street Soccer Online is a project built entirely by a solo developer. Capturing the essence of street soccer and sharing it with players has been my ultimate goal. I am committed to improving the game with your feedback and taking it to the next level. Your support on this journey means everything to me!</p>","developers":["Jagger Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/3f32e5f53f665fd51e74f455cc0155bedd0bb6f3/header.jpg?t=1763656748","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Copyright 2024 Jagger Game Studio. All rights reserved. H\u00fcseyin Ar\u0131 is the owner of the copyright of the product.<br />\r\n\"Icon made by Freepik from www.flaticon.com\"","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3344400/1660184470/208b788fdda88caf59f2f863fb4b835b30e50018/1763128406/dash_av1.